# What the program and its pipeline give the keys of `mdir run`'s GPU
# entries (D397, D227): on the warm cache of the
# dipeptide with PME, a switch of the builder (MDIR_CONSTRAINT_TEST),
# precision, and a pipeline that MDIR_PIPELINE replaces with one option
# changed each store new entries for the kernels they change and read the
# rest; the same pipeline through MDIR_PIPELINE, and a start from another
# cell, whose edges are arguments of the entry, store none. Settings that
# change only the host code of `mdir run`, which is not cached before #99,
# are in compile-cache-program.test and compile-cache-program-host-gpu.test
# (Inputs/compile_cache_run.py).
#
# REQUIRES: cuda
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/compile_cache_run.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide %t program mdir | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: cold: ptx compiled [[M:[1-9][0-9]*]] read 0 cubins compiled [[M]] read 0; new ptx [[M]] cubin [[M]]
# CHECK-NEXT: constraint-test: ptx compiled [[A:[1-9][0-9]*]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}} cubins compiled [[A]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}}; new ptx [[A]] cubin [[A]]
# CHECK-NEXT: precision: ptx compiled [[B:[1-9][0-9]*]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}} cubins compiled [[B]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}}; new ptx [[B]] cubin [[B]]
# CHECK-NEXT: mdir-pipeline: ptx compiled [[C:[1-9][0-9]*]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}} cubins compiled [[C]] read {{[1-9][0-9]*}}; new ptx [[C]] cubin [[C]]
# CHECK-NEXT: same-pipeline: ptx compiled 0 read [[M]] cubins compiled 0 read [[M]]; new ptx 0 cubin 0
# CHECK-NEXT: other-cell: ptx compiled 0 read [[M]] cubins compiled 0 read [[M]]; new ptx 0 cubin 0
